close_reason: "Implemented and locally validated bounded authenticated Jellyfin 10.11.11 event streaming: typed 28-message catalog, periodic read subscriptions, keepalive, strict resource limits/redaction, TOON and NDJSON schemas, full docs, 26 focused tests, 183/183 compiled live read-only E2E tests, and green PM-isolated release validation. Canonical repo-wide coverage and duplication gaps remain open as jf-mkzh and jf-lpki."
plan_mode: completed
plan_scope: Official WebSocket transport and server-event subscriptions; bounded watch execution; NDJSON/JSON/TOON agent output; no Jellyfin mutations.
plan_harness: codex
plan_resume_context: Latest stable and live server are Jellyfin 10.11.11. REST coverage is 429/429; WebSocket events are absent. Credentials remain only in owner-only ~/.jellyfin-cli and live tests must set JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1.
plan_validation[1]{text,command,expected}:
  Focused compiled live read-only event acceptance,JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1 JELLYFIN_E2E_USE_DIST=1 bun test --test-name-pattern 'E2E events' tests/e2e/cli.test.ts,Two event tests pass and no Jellyfin state changes or private payload persistence occur.
plan_decisions[1]{ts,author,decision,rationale,evidence}:
  "2026-07-27T21:16:48.934Z",codex-jellyfin-realtime,Implement the transport with the Node/Bun standards-compatible WebSocket API rather than adding the full Jellyfin SDK runtime dependency.,"The CLI needs a small streaming boundary, while the official SDK source remains the protocol reference. A native adapter preserves package size, explicit bounds, and full control of redaction/output without guessing types.",Jellyfin v10.11.11 server message classes and @jellyfin/sdk 0.13.0 WebSocketService/constants inspected on 2026-07-27.
plan_discoveries[1]{ts,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:16:47.793Z",codex-jellyfin-realtime,"Official Jellyfin v10.11.11 is the latest stable release; the live server reports 10.11.11 and 429 REST operations. Official server sources expose /socket messages outside OpenAPI, including LibraryChanged, UserDataChanged, Sessions, ScheduledTasksInfo, plugin lifecycle, timers, playback, SyncPlay, and server lifecycle messages."
plan_steps[6]{id,order,title,status,created_at,updated_at,evidence,completed_at}:
  plan-step-001,1,Research official and live WebSocket contracts,completed,"2026-07-27T21:16:28.529Z","2026-07-27T21:16:52.362Z","Verified v10.11.11 release and live version, official server inbound/outbound message classes, /socket auth path, ForceKeepAlive behavior, subscription timing strings, and official TypeScript SDK 0.13.0 implementation.","2026-07-27T21:16:52.362Z"
  plan-step-002,2,Implement typed WebSocket transport and event catalog,completed,"2026-07-27T21:16:28.529Z","2026-07-27T21:30:09.428Z","Added typed 28-message Jellyfin 10.11 catalog, three periodic read subscriptions, native Node/Bun WebSocket adapter, official ApiKey URL construction, strict JSON/size validation, ForceKeepAlive response, and deterministic count/duration/close/abort lifecycle.","2026-07-27T21:30:09.428Z"
  plan-step-003,3,Implement bounded jf events commands and output contracts,completed,"2026-07-27T21:16:28.529Z","2026-07-27T21:30:11.125Z","Added jf events types/watch help, exact filters, subscription selectors, control filtering, record/duration/connection/message/rate bounds, TOON-default aggregate output, explicit NDJSON streaming, and event_types/event_watch/event_stream_record schemas.","2026-07-27T21:30:11.125Z"
  plan-step-004,4,"Add unit, integration, portable, and live read-only tests",completed,"2026-07-27T21:16:28.529Z","2026-07-27T21:41:19.938Z","Focused Bun 26/26 and portable Vitest 25 passed with one intentional Bun-only server skip; full compiled live E2E passed 183/183 with JELLYFIN_READ_ONLY=1; event transport coverage is 96% statements, 90.76% branches, 100% functions, and 100% lines; constructor failures are credential-redacted.","2026-07-27T21:41:19.938Z"
  plan-step-005,5,"Document agent usage, API research, security, and troubleshooting",completed,"2026-07-27T21:16:28.529Z","2026-07-27T21:41:20.786Z","Updated README and docs index, API reference, official/live API research, agent NDJSON/TOON workflows, security boundary, and troubleshooting; all docs cross-link the discoverable event catalog and bounded watch contract.","2026-07-27T21:41:20.786Z"
  plan-step-006,6,Validate local release gates and PM evidence,completed,"2026-07-27T21:16:28.529Z","2026-07-27T21:50:45.609Z","PM-isolated release validation passes after explicitly binding changelog generation to .agents/pm; PM validate is warning-free, graph audit has 44 nodes/99 edges and no findings, duplicate search returns none, live E2E passed 183/183, and unresolved repo-wide coverage/duplication remain linked to jf-mkzh/jf-lpki. Exact-head GitHub checks and bot review remain delivery gates outside the implementation plan.","2026-07-27T21:50:45.609Z"
